Expected crack widths for the three levels: $w_m$ = 0.7 / 0.5 / 0.25 mm and $w_"max"$ = 1.2 / 0.9 / 0.4 mm ($w_"max"$ = 1.7 · $w_m$, 95 % fractile), based on the tension chord model (SIA documentation D 0182).
